(7786793, 1296254, 36065, '<td valign="top">
<b>Hey there from the Critique Club</b>
<br/>
<br/><b>My thoughts on the image:</b> I am surprised that this one did not do a little better.  I think it is a bit over-sharpened, but it is still, in my opinion, more pleasing than some that finished ahead of it.
<br/>
<br/><b>My ideas for improvement: </b> To me, this would have been a perfect image to really stretch out that lens and compress your DOF.  Had the Bison been in sharp focus with some blurring of the BG, I think this one would have made a bigger impression.
<br/>
<br/><b>Where I would have/did score this entry:</b> I also scored this one a 5.  I think with some changes in the DOF, this one could have easily been a top 5.
<br/>
<br/>Thank you for the opportunity to provide a critique on your entry,
<br/><b>Eric</b>
<br/></td>', 'Hey there from the Critique Club

My thoughts on the image: I am surprised that this one did not do a little better.  I think it is a bit over-sharpened, but it is still, in my opinion, more pleasing than some that finished ahead of it.

My ideas for improvement:  To me, this would have been a perfect image to really stretch out that lens and compress your DOF.  Had the Bison been in sharp focus with some blurring of the BG, I think this one would have made a bigger impression.

Where I would have/did score this entry: I also scored this one a 5.  I think with some changes in the DOF, this one could have easily been a top 5.

Thank you for the opportunity to provide a critique on your entry,
Eric', '2025-08-11 11:05:07.000000', NULL, 0),
