(7786795, 1296202, 175381, '<td valign="top">
Hello,
<br/>Thank you for your valuable comments, which I welcome in my heart. Can you believe this is my first time photographing a hummingbird? I actually created a floral display to attract this famous hummingbird, and I was immensely delighted when I realized I had managed to capture it in flight. It''s quite a challenge, believe me. Once again, thank you for your kind words.</td>', 'Hello,
Thank you for your valuable comments, which I welcome in my heart. Can you believe this is my first time photographing a hummingbird? I actually created a floral display to attract this famous hummingbird, and I was immensely delighted when I realized I had managed to capture it in flight. It''s quite a challenge, believe me. Once again, thank you for your kind words.', '2025-08-11 11:16:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7786796, 1296263, 175381, '<td valign="top">
Congratulations on winning the red ribbon. A hummingbird in flight, captured with impressive clarity on the body. The framing is dynamic, with the hummingbird facing right, giving a sense of freedom and momentum. The soft, circular bokeh creates a serene, almost ethereal ambiance, enhancing the beauty of the suspended moment.
<br/>Congratulations again</td>', 'Congratulations on winning the red ribbon. A hummingbird in flight, captured with impressive clarity on the body. The framing is dynamic, with the hummingbird facing right, giving a sense of freedom and momentum. The soft, circular bokeh creates a serene, almost ethereal ambiance, enhancing the beauty of the suspended moment.
Congratulations again', '2025-08-11 11:22:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(7786798, 1296274, 175381, '<td valign="top">
Congratulations on winning the red ribbon. The deep black background brings out the details of the plumage and the bright colors of the beak and legs. It''s a more dramatic, almost cinematic atmosphere. The feathers are rendered with remarkable finesse you can almost feel their softness and density. It''s a very expressive, almost majestic photo. It evokes vigilance, solitude, or even discreet nobility. Congratulations<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2025-08-11 15:21:17.</i></td>', 'Congratulations on winning the red ribbon. The deep black background brings out the details of the plumage and the bright colors of the beak and legs. It''s a more dramatic, almost cinematic atmosphere. The feathers are rendered with remarkable finesse you can almost feel their softness and density. It''s a very expressive, almost majestic photo. It evokes vigilance, solitude, or even discreet nobility. Congratulations', '2025-08-11 11:26:17.000000', '2025-08-11 15:21:17.000000', 0),
(7786799, 1295956, 175381, '<td valign="top">
Congratulations on yellow ribbon. The eye is naturally guided to the center of the action—the mother''s beak touching a baby''s. This is the point of connection, the heart of the photo. It''s an image that speaks of care, transmission, and the cycle of life. It could illustrate a story, a nature awareness campaign, or simply be admired for its raw beauty. Good work<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2025-08-11 15:21:53.</i></td>', 'Congratulations on yellow ribbon. The eye is naturally guided to the center of the action—the mother''s beak touching a baby''s. This is the point of connection, the heart of the photo. It''s an image that speaks of care, transmission, and the cycle of life. It could illustrate a story, a nature awareness campaign, or simply be admired for its raw beauty. Good work', '2025-08-11 11:29:25.000000', '2025-08-11 15:21:53.000000', 0),
(7786800, 1296273, 175381, '<td valign="top">
Congratulations on yellow ribbon. There''s a real narrative here, a pause in the wild, a moment of connection. It''s rare to capture animals in such an expressive and gentle pose. This image could illustrate the beauty of family bonds in nature, or simply remind us that even the most independent creatures have their moments of tenderness. Very nice capture.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2025-08-11 15:22:38.</i></td>', 'Congratulations on yellow ribbon. There''s a real narrative here, a pause in the wild, a moment of connection. It''s rare to capture animals in such an expressive and gentle pose. This image could illustrate the beauty of family bonds in nature, or simply remind us that even the most independent creatures have their moments of tenderness. Very nice capture.', '2025-08-11 11:32:14.000000', '2025-08-11 15:22:38.000000', 0),
